  "description": "Frampton is the fourth studio album by English rock musician Peter Frampton, released in 1975. It was his last studio release before he went on tour and recorded his live album Frampton Comes Alive!. The most popular songs from the album are \"Show Me the Way\" and \"Baby, I Love Your Way\", which became big hits when released as singles from Frampton Comes Alive! The album peaked No. 32 on the US Billboard Top LPs & Tape chart.",
